<title>USA: Marshall, Minn., $2.300 mln won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Marshall, Minn., $2.300 mln won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $2.300 million of Marshall, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1996 B, with a true interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
</text>
